  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/6Dn7NvW.png\" alt=\"標題\"></p><h5 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/2CUh6gMuCt\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1027252425960198165?color=5b6ee1&amp;label=Discord&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"Discord\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/MarsThePlanet\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/endpoint.svg?url=https://shieldsio-patreon.vercel.app/api?username=MarsThePlanet&amp;type=patrons&amp;style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"在Patreon上支持我\"></a> <a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lava-turns-sand-into-glass-fabric-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/883465?color=F16436&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white&amp;label=Curseforge&amp;style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"CurseForge\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252flava-turns-sand-into-glass\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/lava-turns-sand-into-glass?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;logoColor=white&amp;label=modrinth&amp;color=00AF5C\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a> </strong></h5><p style=\"text-align:center\"><br>這個可設定的模組讓沙塊在接觸到熔岩時立即轉化為玻璃。非常適合建立玻璃農場，或只是為遊戲增添一點樂趣。</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/DXY3iwp.png\" width=\"524\"></p><p><strong>設定：</strong></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>您可以直接在遊戲內設定此模組，或編輯個人資料夾中的JSON檔案 <code>config/lavasand.json</code>。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>blocks_to_glass</strong> - 熔岩會轉化為玻璃的方塊清單</p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/JNZ2GMV.png\"> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/deimos-fabric-forge-neoforge\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/83sD0W8.png\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fdeimos\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/j2GIPnt.png\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/marstheplanet\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/rJIRiP5.png\"></a></p>",
